# MEMORY.md

> Long-term memory. Curated. The dreaming pass proposes additions; you accept them. Loaded once per session.
>
> This is the template that ships with WormHole. On first run, copy it to `MEMORY.md` (`wormhole init` does this) and fill in over time. Keep entries short. If a section grows past 30 lines, that section probably wants to become a module's `CONTEXT.md` instead.

